is desk. And never, ever argue with Miss Pierce."], ["G", "Who's Miss Pierce?"], ["H", "You'll know her when you hear her."], ["G", "I think I already met her."]]}, {"n": 12, "t": {"E": "20261006_195323_5ef2f355-d969-4e06-908d-74ee377acc4c", "H": "20261006_194232_106eb72e-0a93-4459-8d99-b1687db450a4"}, "amb": "int_day", "l": [["H", "Good morning, Mr. Caldwell."], ["E", "Good morning, Mrs. Hayes."], ["H", "This is Grace. New staff."]], "lt": [["ETHAN CALDWELL", "CEO, Caldwell Freight", 0.8, 5.2]]}, {"n": 13, "t": {"G": "20261006_185254_a3480218-1fe7-4fb5-b76d-109e56f542e3", "E": "20261006_195323_f1f12242-68de-4425-9f75-8e293ebfdaad", "H": "20261006_190942_006d4337-38f4-473d-96a0-1c08ce623e81"}, "amb": "int_day", "l": [["E", "Ethan. Welcome, Grace."], ["G", "Thank you, sir."], ["E", "If Mrs. Hayes gives you a hard time, you're on your own."], ["H", "I heard that."]]}, {"n": 14, "t": {"X": "20261006_183013_8cb92699-48cc-420b-89bd-d7ab8a08e5d9"}, "amb": "int_day"}, {"card": "TWO WEEKS LATER"}, {"n": 15, "t": {"X": "20261006_183046_e0e21abd-fc7d-4d34-923c-acd84fd9350d"}, "amb": "int_day"}, {"n": 16, "t": {"X": "20261006_183013_9b060534-fe03-4e55-a5d5-b119a4bdef7a"}, "amb": "int_day"}, {"n": 17, "t": {"X": "20261006_183013_76672a00-3eaf-495b-9493-d041364699db"}, "amb": "int_day"}, {"n": 18, "t": {"E": "20261006_195323_a97ed34a-1219-4e0a-9ba2-a7b76c69429e"}, "amb": "kitchen_day"}, {"n": 19, "t": {"X": "20261006_183046_0c5480c0-e76f-4084-96da-0abbdfbd9a45"}, "amb": "kitchen_day"}, {"n": 20, "t": {"G": "20261006_185254_940d91dc-3f7d-4021-9455-e487fcdad768", "E": "20261006_195322_ead04b52-5ed7-4905-99b5-cce5a8fcfb8c"}, "amb": "kitchen_day", "l": [["G", "Try it now."], ["E", "That's perfect. How did you know?"], ["G", "You've burned your tongue three mornings in a row, sir. A man who runs three hundred trucks can wait one minute for coffee."]]}, {"n": 21, "t": {"G": "20261006_185254_13ce45b6-54b9-4506-a46f-41940dff1aeb", "E": "20261006_195324_744b3eca-11b6-46a8-9296-c33be4c83b